Lab 12: Accessing VM Consoles
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Understand the difference between VNC and SPICE console protocols
Enable console access for virtual machines in Red Hat Virtualization Manager (RHVM)
Access VM consoles through the RHVM web interface
Perform basic system administration tasks using console access
Troubleshoot common console connectivity issues
Configure console security settings and user permissions
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with Red Hat Virtualization Manager (RHVM) interface
Knowledge of virtual machine concepts and management
Understanding of network protocols and remote access concepts
